# Spaced Repetition Schedule

Missed concepts are tracked here with increasing review intervals.
The exam skill updates this file after grading. The /review command lists what's due.

## Interval Progression

Missed → 1 day → 3 days → 7 days → 14 days → 30 days → Mastered (removed)
A missed concept resets to the 1-day interval.

## Entry Format

```
| Concept | Domain | Last Reviewed | Next Due | Interval |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| IROL Tv ≤ 30 min | Contingency | 2026-03-25 | 2026-03-26 | 1d |
```

